WEBVTT

00:07:58.161 --> 00:08:00.593
among all population
perinatal health measures,

00:08:00.617 --> 00:08:02.133
according to the CDC.

00:08:02.990 --> 00:08:05.210
And these disparities
are even more pronounced

00:08:05.234 --> 00:08:06.752
in some of our cities.

00:08:06.776 --> 00:08:08.930
For example, in New York City,

00:08:08.954 --> 00:08:12.357
a black woman is eight to 12 times
more likely to die

00:08:12.381 --> 00:08:15.806
from a pregnancy-related cause
than is a white woman.

00:08:16.822 --> 00:08:19.239
Now, I think many of you
are probably familiar with

00:08:19.263 --> 00:08:21.860
the heart-wrenching story
of Dr. Shalon Irving,

00:08:21.884 --> 00:08:25.869
a CDC epidemiologist
who died following childbirth.

00:08:25.893 --> 00:08:29.477
Her story was reported
in ProPublica and NPR

00:08:29.501 --> 00:08:31.410
a little less than a year ago.